@page "/about"

<!-- Hero Wrapper med bild, rubrik och text ovanpå -->
<div class="hero-background-wrapper">
    <div class="about-hero-section">
        <img src="/images/about.png" alt="About The Loading Bean" class="about-hero-bg-image" />
        <div class="hero-overlay">
            <div class="hero-text-wrapper">
                <h1 class="hero-title">About The Loading Bean</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">A nerdy sanctuary for coffee, tea and pixelated dreams.</p>
                <p class="hero-caption">Created for late-night coding, gaming, and creative chaos</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Textkort med padding och centrering -->
<div class="about-card slim-card mt-6 mb-6">

    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        Welcome to <strong>The Loading Bean</strong> – your nerdy oasis for coffee, tea, and accessories.
        Whether you’re grinding late in a dungeon, battling bugs in code, or just chilling with friends – we believe every quest deserves great coffee.
        Here, gamers, coders, streamers, and dreamers all find a place to recharge and feel at home.
    </MudText>

    <MudDivider Class="my-4" />

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="font-weight-bold">
        Our Mission
    </MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        We aim to combine flavor, fun and function. Whether you need a 'Bug Fix Blend' to conquer a project, a 'Mana Brew' to power through a boss fight, or just a comforting cup to start your day – we’ve got you covered.
    </MudText>

    <MudDivider Class="my-4" />

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="font-weight-bold">
        Powered by Passion
    </MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        Crafted with heart, fueled by coffee, and inspired by the worlds of code and gaming.
        The Loading Bean is more than just a store – it’s a love letter to all of us who thrive on creativity, curiosity, and caffeine.<br>
        <b>"Great code – and epic games – begin with great coffee."</b>
    </MudText>

</div>
